; An amount past the syntax error is never read, so it does not count:
; USD has no digits once and two digits twice.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "kept"
  Assets:A   20.00 USD
  Assets:B  -20.00 USD

2020-01-03 * "dropped by a syntax error"
  Assets:A   1 USD 5
  Assets:B  -1 USD
  Assets:B  -1 USD
